<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MIC" style="id">- Gamo Full Bible final version</book>
  <para style="h">Mikiyaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mikiyaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mikiyaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="toc3">Miki</para>
  <para style="mt1">Mikiyaasa Tinbite</para>
  <para style="imt1">Giddo Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Mikiyaasi Isayaasay diza wode diza nabe gidishin izas yeletay dugeha bagga Yuhudan kawoteththa garsan diza issi dere garsan diza kataman dees; Amoxey pudeha bagga kawoteththa bolla metoy gakkanayssa yootoyssaththo Mikiyaasikka he hanoti Yuhuda kawoteththa bolla gakkanayssa kaseti yootides. Derezi ooththiza iita hanoti pirda pace gishshas Xoossi ba pirda ehanayssa qofsides; gido attiin Mikiyaasa tinbite qaalay sinththafe hidotay dizayssa bessiza malatatakka gaththi oykkides. Harappeka lo7eththi xeellanaas bessiza kifileti Xoossa godateththa garsan kumeththa alamen saroteththi daanayssa (4:1-40), Dawite zereththafe gita kawoy yiikko derezas saroteththi imettanayssa (5:2-40) Hessaththoka kase Isra7eele nabeti yootida qaalay ubbayka issi xiqisen qashettida mala qoncciseettes; hinna he xiqiseyakka, «Izi nuuppe koyzayssa nu ooththana mala, kiyateththi kumida siiqo nu bessana malanne nuni nu godaara kumeththa ashketeththan daana malassa.» [6:8]</para>
  <para style="iot">Ha Maxaafay Oykkida Kumeththa Qofa</para>
  <para style="io1">GODAY ba asaa qaxxayees <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 1:1-2:11">1:1—2:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sinththara diza hidota <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 2:12-13">2:12-13</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossi dere kaaleththiza iitatanne wordo nabeta qaxxayana <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ooraththa Isra7eelen Xoossa keeth ooraththa <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 4:1-5:15">4:1—5:15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Isra7eeley ooththida qoho qoncceth <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 6:1-7:7">6:1—7:7</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Derezi Xoossako simo <char style="ior"><ref loc="MIC 7:8-20">7:8-20</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MIC 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 1:1" />Yuhuda kawo Iyo7aatame, Akaazenne Hizqiyaasa wode Moreshete as gidida Mikiyaasakko Samaariya gishshassinne Yerusalaame gishshas yida Xoossa qaalay hayssa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:32-16:20">2Kawo 15:32—16:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:1-20:21">18:1—20:21</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 27:1-7">2Taari 27:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:1-32:33">28:1—32:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="MIC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 1:2" />Intteno deretoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">intte wurikka siyite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">Ha biitta bolla dizayti wurikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">haa ezgi siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">salo GODAY ba geeshsha keeththaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">uttidi intte iita oosoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:2">intte bolla markkattees.<verse eid="MIC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samaariya Bollanne Yerusalaame Bolla Yida Pirda</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 1:3" />Hekko Xoossi ba dizasoppe yaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:3">yiidikka biitta bollan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:3">dhoqqasohon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:3">dhoqqasohon hemettana.<verse eid="MIC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 1:4" />Muqaadday tama be7idi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:4">seeriza malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:4">haaththi aafora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:4">duge goggiza mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:4">he wode zumati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:4">iza toho garsan seerana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:4">shoobbatikka phalqetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 1:4">wodhdhana.<verse eid="MIC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 1:5" />Hessi wuri hananay Yaaqoobey ooththida mooro gishshassinne Isra7eele nayta nagara gishshassa; Isra7eele asay iita ooththanaas gaaso gididay oonee? Izis waanna katamayo Samaariya gidekkee? Yuhuda asay eeqa goynnidi nagara ooththana mala gaththiday oonee? Yerusalaame gidekkee? <verse eid="MIC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 1:6" />Hessa gishshas tani Samaariya keeth laallettidasonne woyne miththi tokettizaso kessana; iza keexettida yochcha shuchcha ta duge shoobban olananne izi xapho shodda dhayssana. <verse eid="MIC 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 1:7" />Izi eeqati wurikka meqerettana; izi eeqa keeththan diza laymatizaytas imettidaazi wuri taman xuugettana; izi misletakka ubbaa ta dhayssana; iza baas imettidayssa layman shiishshida mala ha7ikka izis dizaazi layman ekkizaaz gidana.<verse eid="MIC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeehonne Ceece</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 1:8" />Hessa geedon tani yeekkays, wuu! Wuy gays; ta caammay baynda mela tohoninne mela kallo bays; worakana mala waassays; gutto mala waassays. <verse eid="MIC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 1:9" />Izi madunththay paxonttaaz gidana; izippe aadhdhi Yuhudassara gidana; ta derey geliza penge Yerusalaame gakkides. <verse eid="MIC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 1:10" />Geete deren haasayopite; yeeho mulekka yeekkofte; Beeti-Li7ofaaran gudulla bolla genderettite. <verse eid="MIC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 1:11" />Intteno Shafiren dizaytoo may7oy baynda kallo Yeellatishe aadhdhite; Xa7inan dizayti heeppe kezettenna; Beeti-Ezeeley ceece bolla dawus; intteska gakki shempanaaso gidanaas dandayukku. <verse eid="MIC 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 1:12" />Metoppe shempanaas koshshan Maroten dizayti meton waayetteettes; hessika Yerusalaame penge gakkanaas iita metoy Xoossa achchafe yida gishshassa. <verse eid="MIC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 1:13" />Intteno Laakishen dizaytoo parata gaarera gaththi oyseththite. Xiyoone macca naytas koyro nagaray inttenakko. Isra7eeles qohoy intte achchafe beettides. <verse eid="MIC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 1:14" />Hessa gishshas intte Moreshet-Gates imota immana; Akiziibe katamay Isra7eele kawota baleththiza katama gidana. <verse eid="MIC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 1:15" />Inttenoo Mareeshan dizaytoo! Ta inttena xoonizaade intte bolla ehana; Isra7eeles bonchcho gididaazi Adulaame ha yaana. <verse eid="MIC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 1:16" />Intte isttan ufayettiza intte nayti inttefe di7etti baana gishshas intte hu7e bulusite.<verse eid="MIC 1:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MIC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Asa Qofanne Xoossa Qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 2:1" />Iita ooththanaas qoppizaytassinne hiixan dishe gene ooththanaas yo7o tukkizaytas aayye ana! Omars qoppoyssa maalado wonttara poleettessinne hessa ooththanaaskka wolqqara deettes. <verse eid="MIC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 2:2" />Asa gade amottida mala oykkeettes; asa keeththika amottidi ekkeettes; ba lagge keeththinne biitta baleththon ekkeettes. <verse eid="MIC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 2:3" />Hessa gishshas Xoossi, «Hekko ta hessa mala dere bolla dhayssizaaz ekka yaana qoppadis; intte qasse hessafe kessi ekkana dandayekketa; intte bolla metoy yiza gishshas hessafe guye intte otoreteththan simeretteketa. <verse eid="MIC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 2:4" />He wode derey intte bolla miicci kaa7ana; inttena qidhishe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 2:4">« ‹Nu mulera dhaydos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:4">ta dabbo gadey haras gishettides;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:4">taappe bonqqi ekkidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:4">nu biitta nuna Xoonidaytas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:4">gishides› gi zilalana» gides.<verse eid="MIC 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 2:5" />Hessa gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:5">Xoossa duulata giddon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:5">gade saama yeggi gishanaadey</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 2:5">oonikka deenna.<verse eid="MIC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wordo Nabeta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 2:6" />Istta nabeti, «Tinbite nu bolla yootoppa; heytantta gishshas tinbite nuus yootoppa; nu bolla kawushshateththi gakkenna» gaana. <verse eid="MIC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 2:7" />«Yaaqoobe soo asatoo hessaththo geetettanaas bessizee? Xoossa ayanay aggi aadhdherennee? Heytantta malakka ooththizee?» gi oychchana; «Suure oge hemettizaytas ta qaalay lo7o ooththi erennee? <verse eid="MIC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 2:8" />Wurseththan intte ta dereta bolla morkke gidi dendideta; isttas ola qofay baynda dishin saroteththara aadhdhizayta bollafe seelo may7o intte qaari ekkideta. <verse eid="MIC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 2:9" />Istti dosiza istta keeththafe ta asa macca nayta kessi efideta; ta bonchchoka istta naytappe mernaas ekkideta. <verse eid="MIC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 2:10" />Dendidi hessafe kichchite; hessi inttes shempposo gidenna; gaasoykka tunidessinne daro moorettides. <verse eid="MIC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 2:11" />Baleththiza wordo asi yiidi, ‹Daro woyne ushshu gishshassinne maththosiza ushsha gishshas giidi tinbite inttes yootana› giikko hayssa derezas dosettida nabe gidana.<verse eid="MIC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">As Ashshanaas Imettida Hidota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 2:12" />«Yaaqoobe! Tumappe ta inttena issiso shiishshana; Isra7eeletappe attidayta ta issi bolla ehana; yire giddon diza mehe malanne demban heemettiza mehe mala tani inttena issi bolla shiishshana; intte derey wuri as xalla gidana. <verse eid="MIC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 2:13" />Menththizay isttafe kaseti kezi baana; isttika pengeza menththidi kezi baana; istta kawoy Xoossay isttafe sinththe aadhdhi kaaleththana» gida.<verse eid="MIC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MIC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Iita oge Kaaleththizaytanne Wordo Nabeta Bolla Xoossa Hanqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 3:1" />Qasseka, «Intteno Yaaqoobe kaaleththizaytanne Isra7eele keeththa asaa haarizaytoo siyite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:1">intte tumu pirda eranaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:1">inttes bessennee?<verse eid="MIC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 3:2" />Intte lo7o ixxideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:2">iita qasse dosideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:2">ta asaa galba shooqideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:2">istta ashokka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:2">meqeththafe shaakkideta.<verse eid="MIC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 3:3" />Ta asaa asho mideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">galbaaka shooqideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">istta meqeththika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">menththereththideta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">asho caaciza bashen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">caaciza malanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">distten doyssiza asho mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:3">qanxxereththideta» ta gadis.<verse eid="MIC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 3:4" />Isttika pude Xoossako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:4">waassana shin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:4">Xoossi istta waaso siyenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:4">iitateththaa gishshas he wode</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:4">Xoossay ba ayfeso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:4">isttafe haraso zaarana.<verse eid="MIC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 3:5" />Xoossi, «Ta dere baleththiza nabeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:5">asi istta mizikko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:5">‹Saroteththi dees› geettes.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:5">Muzontta aggiko qasse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:5">‹Olay yees›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:5">gi awajjanaas dendeteettes.<verse eid="MIC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 3:6" />Hessa gishshas istta bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:6">qammay beettontta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:6">dhumay erontta gakki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:6">wodhdhana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:6">nabeta bolla arshey gelananne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:6">gallassay isttas qammana.<verse eid="MIC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 3:7" />Buro marotizayti kawuyana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:7">tinbite yootizayti yeellatana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:7">wurikka ba ayfeso kammana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:7">gaasoykka isttas zaaroy</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:7">Xoossa achchafe baynda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:7">gishshassa» gides.<verse eid="MIC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 3:8" />Ta qasse Yaaqoobes</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">iza qohoza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">Isra7eelesikka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">iza nagara yootanaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">wolqqan, Xoossa ayanan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">tuma pirdaninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:8">minoteththan kumadis.<verse eid="MIC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 3:9" />Intteno Yaaqoobe soo asa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:9">kaaleththizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:9">Intteno Isra7eele dere haarizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:9">Tumu pirda kadhizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:9">Tumu gididaaz</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:9">ubbaa mirqqizaytoo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:9">Ane siyite.<verse eid="MIC 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 3:10" />Xiyoone, asa suuth gussoninne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:10">Yerusalaame iitateththan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:10">kunththizayto!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:10">Ane siyite.<verse eid="MIC 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 3:11" />Kaaleththizayti matta7es pirdeettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">qeeseti miishsha gishshas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">tamaarseettes;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">Nabetikka miishshe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">mida gishshas yooteettes.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:11">Hessa ubbaa ooththidikka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">«Xoossi nu giddon dees gidennee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">Ay iitaykka nu bolla gakkenna» gishe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:11">Xoossan ceeqeteettes.<verse eid="MIC 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 3:12" />Hessa gishshas intte geedon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:12">Xiyooney goshsha biitta mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:12">goyettana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 3:12">Yerusalaameykka qolettida</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:12">keeththa doore gidana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:12">Xoossa Keeththay diza zumaykka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:12">sharafa maatay iza bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 3:12">diccida zuma gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 26:18">Er 26:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MIC 3:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MIC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossa Zuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 4:1" />Wurseththa wode</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MIC 4:1">Xoossa keeththi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:1">iza bolla diza zumay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:1">hara zuma ubbaafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:1">aadhdhi beettana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:1">hara zumatappe bollara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:1">dhoqqu gaana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:1">dereykka izakko goochchana.<verse eid="MIC 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 4:2" />Daro kawoteththati izakko yiidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">«Xoossa zumaakko haa yiite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">Yaaqoobe Godaakko ane boos;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">nu iza ogera baana mala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">nuna izi ba oge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">tamaarsana» gida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">wogay Xiyooneppe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">Xoossa qaalay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:2">qasse Yerusalaameppe yaana.<verse eid="MIC 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 4:3" />Izi daro asa giddon pirdana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">haahoninne matan diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">wolqqama katama giddon diza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">oosh essana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">istti ba giththa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">mashsha maarasha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">ba toorakka baaca histti qoxxana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">issi kawoy hara kawo bolla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">mashsha denththenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">hessafe guye istti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:3">ola timirte tamaarettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:10">Iyu 3:10</ref></char></note><verse eid="MIC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 4:4" />Issi asi ba woyne miththa garsankka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:4">ba balase miththa garsan uttana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:4">istta babisiza miishshi deenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:4">Ubbaafe wolqqama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:4">GODAA doonay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MIC 4:4">hayssa yootides.<verse eid="MIC 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 4:5" />Hankko derey ba eeqa sunththan bees; nuni qasse mernaappe mernaa gakkanaas nu GODAA sunththan baana.<verse eid="MIC 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buroppe Hanana Xoossa Qofa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 4:6" />GODAY, «Tani he gallas gundidayta shiishshana; bete bidaytanne muuzottana mala ta aaththa immidayta ubbaa issiso shiishshana. <verse eid="MIC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 4:7" />Gundatappe attidaytanne qohettidayta ta istta mino dere kessana; he gallassayfe doommidi mernaa gakkanaas GODAY Xiyoone zuman istta bolla kawotana. <verse eid="MIC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 4:8" />Haysso nenan uttidi mehe heemmiza dhoqqa zumazoo! Xiyoone macca nayta naagana giiga uttida zumazoo! Beni ne haariza derey nees simmana; ne kawoteththay Yerusalaame macca nays gidana. <verse eid="MIC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 4:9" />Histtiin ne ha7i aazas waassay? Nees kawoy bayee? Neni miixay oykkida maccassay mala un7ettiday nena zorizay dhaynee? <verse eid="MIC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 4:10" />Hanne Xiyoone macca nayee! Miixattiza maccassay mala ne metotana; ha7i qasse ne katamappe gede kezada coo demban de7ana bessiza gishshas Baabiloone baana; ne hee baada heen ne morkketa kusheppe attana; GODAY nena heen ne morkketappe ashshana. <verse eid="MIC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 4:11" />Ha7i qasse daro hankko dere asay ne bolla shiiqides; Isttika, ‹Hanna tunidaaz gidu! nu ayfey Xiyoono qidhen xeello› gaana. <verse eid="MIC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 4:12" />Gido attiin istti Xoossa qofa erettenna; bukettanaas balen shiiqiza mirqqe kaththa mala bana shiishshizaade qofa istti erettenna. <verse eid="MIC 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 4:13" />Hanne Xiyoone nayee dendada kaththaa bukka; ta nees birata kacenne xarqimala xugunth immana; nekka hankko dereza izan liiqisana» gides. Istti genen shiishshidayssa Xoossas, istta haarokka ubbaa biitta ubbaa haariza Godaas ne shiishshandasa.<verse eid="MIC 4:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MIC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Beeteliheemeppe Haarizaadey Yaanayssas Imettida Hidota Qaala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 5:1" />Hanne neni ola asata katamaye, ne ola asaa ziirsa. Nuna oykkanaas yuuyi aadhdhida; Isra7eele haarizayssas shagalan guufera shocana. <verse eid="MIC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 5:2" />Hanne ne qasse Beeteliheeme Efraata, Yuhuda zarkketappe neni guuth gidikkoka izas kessay kase beni wodeppe gidida Isra7eele haarizaadey ne giddofe taas kezana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:6">Mato 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 7:42">Yoha 7:42</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MIC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 5:3" />Hessa gishshas yelizaara miixattada yelana gakkanaas Isra7eeley yegetta attana; hankko attida ishatikka simmidi Isra7eele asara walakettana. <verse eid="MIC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 5:4" />GODAA wolqqan GODAA ba Xoossa sunththa gitateththan minni eqqananne ba mehe izi heemmana; he wode iza wolqqateththay biitta gaxa gakkana gishshas asay giiga duus daana. <verse eid="MIC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 5:5" />Isttas saroteththi iza gidana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MIC 5:5">GODAY Isra7eele Asaa Ashshananne Istta Morkketa Dhayssana Asoore asay nu biitta worajjishin nu miixataka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nu miixata gizayssa kase wode birsheththati nu biitta geettes.</char></note> menththi gelishin laappun heemmizayta hessafekka osppun halaqata nu iza bolla denththana. <verse eid="MIC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 5:6" />Asoore derey mashshan Namuruude derey koohoppe shodettida giththa mashshan haarettana; Asoore asay nu biitta worajjishininne nu dhas bochchishin izi nuna ashshana. <verse eid="MIC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 5:7" />Yaaqoobe zereththafe attidayti daro dere giddon Xoossa achchafe wodhdhiza ira mala maata bolla loddara puusishe biitta kaaleththiza puuse ira mala asappe aykkoka koyontta asa gidana. <verse eid="MIC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 5:8" />Wora do7ata giddon diza gaammoy, ba tohora icci menththereththishe biza mala, menththereththoyssaka izappe oonikka woththi ekkanaas dandayonttayssa mala; Daro dorsa giddon diza wodalla gaammo mala; Yaaqoobe zereththafe attidayti hankko dereta giddoninne daro asa giddon hessa mala gidana. <verse eid="MIC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 5:9" />Ne kushey ne morkketa xoonidi dhoqqu dhoqqu gaana; ne morkketi wurikka dhayana. <verse eid="MIC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 5:10" />He wode Xoossi, «Ta intte giddofe intte parata dhayssana; para-gaaretakka mulera dhayssana. <verse eid="MIC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 5:11" />Intte biittan diza katamatakka dhayssana; intte miixataka ubbaa laallana. <verse eid="MIC 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 5:12" />Intte marotizayssaka dhayssana; hessafe guye marotekketa. <verse eid="MIC 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 5:13" />Masetti kezida intte eeqa misletanne intte eeqasohotakka ta intte giddofe dhayssana; hayssafe guye intte intte kushen ooththidaytas goynneketa. <verse eid="MIC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 5:14" />Asheero geetettiza eeqiza misleyo ta intte giddofe shoddana; ta intte katamaakka dhayssana. <verse eid="MIC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 5:15" />Taas azazettontta dereta wolqqama hanqon ta halo kessana» gees.<verse eid="MIC 5:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MIC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Xoossay Isra7eele Nayta Mootiza Mooto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 6:1" />Xoossi gizayssa siyite; «Dendite! Intte meto zumatas yootite; zumatikka intte gizayssa siyetto. <verse eid="MIC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 6:2" />Zumatoo! Xoossa mooto siyite; Intteno biitta mino xaphotoo siyite; Xoossas asara palamay dees; izi Isra7eele naytara pirdeettes. <verse eid="MIC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 6:3" />Ta derezoo! Ta nena wosttadinaa? Ta nees aazan tooho gidadinaa? Ane taas zaaro imma. <verse eid="MIC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 6:4" />Ta nena Gibxeppe kessadis; aylleteththa biittafekka wozzadis; nena kaaleththana mala Muse, Aaroonenne Maaramo nees yeddadis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:50-51">Kessa 12:50-51</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MIC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 6:5" />Ta derezoo! Mo7aabe kawoy Balaaqey iza zoriin Bi7oore naa Balaamey izas zaaroyssa ane yuushshi qopite; Xoossa xilloteththa ooso intte shaakki erana mala, Shiiximeppe Gelgela gakkanaas intte hemettoyssa ane qopite» gides. <verse eid="MIC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 6:6" />Ta ay ekkada Xoossa sinththe shiiqoo? De7o Xoossas wostta goynnoo? Xuugettiza yarsho issi layththa marara gaththa ekka baada iza sinth shiiqooshaa? <verse eid="MIC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 6:7" />Issi shii dharshotanne 10,000 goggiza zaytey Xoossa ufayssandeeshaa? Ta iza qohoyssa gishshas ta bayra naaza immizaakko ta shemppo nagara gishshas ta uloppe wodhdhida yelo izas immooshaa? <verse eid="MIC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 6:8" />Asa nawu! Izi nena lo7o miish bessides Xoossi neeppe koyzay aazee? Lo7o ooththana mala maaroteth ne dosana malanne Xoossa sinththan neni ashketeththara baana mala gidennee?<verse eid="MIC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Nayta Qohonne Xoossa Hanqo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 6:9" />Xoossas baboy aadhdhida erateththa; Siyite! Xoossi katamayo hizgi xeygees, «Iza hanqo guufeza qopite; hessaka giigsiday oonakko wozinan woththite.» <verse eid="MIC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 6:10" />Iitateththa keeththatoo! Intte genen shiishshida intte miish wordo maka miishshan makki intte shiishshida shuunniza miishshaa ta doganee? <verse eid="MIC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 6:11" />baleththiza maka miish oykkidaade, wordo maka miishsha karaxiiten xunttidaade xillisanaas taas bessizee? <verse eid="MIC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 6:12" />Izi deren dure asati as qohizaadentta; izin diza asay wordanchcha xalla; istta inxarsay baleththiza inxarsa. <verse eid="MIC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 6:13" />Hessa gishshas ta nena dhayssana dendadis; ne nagara geedon ta nena laallana. <verse eid="MIC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 6:14" />Ne maanashin kallaka; ne qanththay coo mela daana; Ne shiishshanashin aykkoka nees shiiqenna; Ne shiishshidayssa tani mashshasinne tooras aaththa immana. <verse eid="MIC 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 6:15" />Ne zerana shin maxakka; wogara miththa zayte ne gum7ana shin he zayteza tiyetta; woyne miththa ayfe xunqqa shiishshanashin woyne ushshu ne uyakka. <verse eid="MIC 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 6:16" />Kawo Omire wogaanne kawo Akaabe keeththa wogaa ne ubbaa shiishsha oykkadasa; nekka istta haysi7e kaalladasa. Hessa gishshas nena dhayssas, ne derezakka tani qidhes aaththa immana; derey ne bolla qidhi kaa7ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:23-34">1Kawo 16:23-34</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:25-26">21:25-26</ref></char></note><verse eid="MIC 6:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MIC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Isra7eele Asa Waaye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MIC 7:1" />Tana aayye ana! Woyne miththa giddofe maxishin attida miththa ayfe bone qoriza asa mala gidadis; meetettiza woyne miththa ayfey deenna; nu izas amottiza eleli gakkiza balase miththa ayfeykka beettibeenna. <verse eid="MIC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MIC 7:2" />Xoossas babbiza asi biitta bollafe dhaydes; suure asi issaadeyka baawa; asi wurikka suuth gussanaas zuggees; issi issi asi ba isha yarden oykkees. <verse eid="MIC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MIC 7:3" />Iza kushey iita ooththanaas tamaardes; dere heemmizaadey kushe genththo koyees; pirdiza daannayka matta7e ekkees; wolqqamati bana koshshidaazi ooththeettes; wurikka issi bolla duulateettes. <verse eid="MIC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MIC 7:4" />Istta garsafe lo7o geetettidaadey agunththa mala keehi lo7o geetettizaadey qasse kindichcho mala inttena naagizaytas wodey gakkides; Xoossa pirda gallassay gakkides; asay shirotana wodey gakkides; <verse eid="MIC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MIC 7:5" />ne lagge ammanoppa; ne laggenkka ammanettofa; ne ki7on nenara aqizaariska ne yootizaaz akeekada yoota. <verse eid="MIC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MIC 7:6" />Attuma nay ba aawa kadhana; macca naykka ba aayi bolla, naa machchaka ba bollotey bolla dendana; asas morkkey soo asa gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:35-36">Mato 10:35-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:53">Luqa 12:53</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MIC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MIC 7:7" />Tani gidikko Xoossa hidota ooththays; tana ashshida ta Xoossaa naagays; ta GODAYKKA taas siyana.<verse eid="MIC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Xoossafe Yida Maarota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MIC 7:8" />Ta morkkezoo! Ta bolla gakkidaazi nena ufayssofo; kundikokka ta dendana; Ta dhuman uttikokka Xoossay taas poo7o gidana. <verse eid="MIC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MIC 7:9" />Ta iza qohida gishshas izi ta gishshas eqqana gakkanaassinne taas pirdana gakkanaas Xoossay hanqettikokka ta dandayana; izi tana poo7on kessana; tanikka iza xilloteth beyana. <verse eid="MIC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MIC 7:10" />Ta morkkezakka hessa beyandus; iza yeellatana. Tana, «GODAA ne Xoossay awan dizee?» gidaari kundeth ta ayfeti beyana; oge urqqa mala iza yedhettana. <verse eid="MIC 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MIC 7:11" />Intte intte katama gimbe gimbiza wodeynne intte dhasika aassiza gallassi yaana. <verse eid="MIC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MIC 7:12" />He gallas asay Asooreppe Gibxe katamata, Gibxeppe Efiraaxise shaafa gakkanaas, abbafe abbaako, zumaappe zumaakko gakkanaas intteko yaana. <verse eid="MIC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MIC 7:13" />Istta ooso geedonne izin diza asaa gaason biittaya aykkoy bayndaaz gidana.<verse eid="MIC 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Galatanne Woosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MIC 7:14" />Wora giddoninne cilila maata giddon barkka dizayti ne mehe gidida ne dereta neni ne guufera heemma; beni wode mala istti Baasaaneninne Gala7aaden heemettetto. <verse eid="MIC 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MIC 7:15" />Ne kase Gibxeppe kezida wodeza mala tani ta malata istta bessana. <verse eid="MIC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MIC 7:16" />Ayzaabeti hessa beyananne yeellatana; isttaskka wolqqay dhayana; istti ba doona ba kushen tuccana; istta hayththika tullana. <verse eid="MIC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MIC 7:17" />Biitta bollara tiran gooshettiza medheteththata mala, shooshsha mala istti biitta laaccana; ba diza gongolo giddofe kokkorishe kezana; babbishe GODAA nu Xoossako simmana; isttika inttes babbana. <verse eid="MIC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MIC 7:18" />Dhayshe attida zereththaa nagara atto gi maariza ne mala Xoossi oonee? Neni mernaas hanqettaka; maaro gelizayssan ne ufayettaasa. <verse eid="MIC 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MIC 7:19" />Simmadakka nuus ne qadhettaasa; nu nagarakka ne toho garsan yedhdhaasa; nu qohozakka ubbaa gede cima abba giddo yeggaasa. <verse eid="MIC 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MIC 7:20" />Beni wodeppe oykkada kase nu aawatas caaqo qaala ne gelida mala Yaaqoobes ammaneteth Abrahaames maaroteth ooththaasa.<verse eid="MIC 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MIC 7" />
</usx>